[Info]
Name	Splitstone
Description	A great stone ridge splits this land in two. Your cave lies on the quiet side, the rich seams lie on the other, and a single narrow passage winds between them. Hold it and you hold everything. Build as you like; nothing here ends the game.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
Sandbox	1
SandboxRealm	Splitstone
SandboxTarget	26000
SandboxBonus	gold	12000	5000	-	Hold 12000 gold at once
SandboxBonus	goldTiles	20	5000	-	Mine out twenty gold seams
SandboxNext	skirmish/Barrackdeep.level
[/Info]

