[Triggers]
Region	Antechamber	19	18	30	27
Region	Gap	5	29	38	41
Region	Field	14	46	42	62
[Trigger]
Name	hello
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Splitstone, master. The ridge to the south cannot be dug, but one narrow path winds through it to a field full of gold. Build your dungeon here, mine in the south, and keep the path guarded.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	gap
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Gap
Action	message	1	You are in the narrow passage. Nothing can walk beside you here, and nothing can pass you either.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	field
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Field
Action	message	1	The southern field is rich in gold. Travellers will come in through the hero portal in the south-east, so bring your creatures along.
Action	gold	1	400
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	antechamberWell
Mode	once
Cond	slabs	1	Antechamber	claimed	>=	15
Action	message	1	The antechamber is claimed and a spring of mana has opened in its middle. Claim it with a worker.
Action	terrain	24	22	24	22	manawell
[/Trigger]
[/Triggers]
